amily:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 7</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>토<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>부터<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 11</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 8</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>까지 블루 아카이브<span lang=\"EN-US\"> ‘5</span>주년 페스티벌<span lang=\"EN-US\">’</span>이 개최될 예정입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">! 🎉</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\">선생님께서 기다리셨을 행사 일정과 장소<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>티켓 예매 일정 및 멤버십 번호 발급 방법을 안내드립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 29</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>화<span lang=\"EN-US\">) </span>낮 12시부터 클린예매 캠페인의 첫 단계인 멤버십 번호 발급이 가능하며</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\">예매 차수 및 ‘패스트트랙<span lang=\"EN-US\">’ </span>혜택 등 새롭게 추가<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>변경된 내용이 있으니,</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\">티켓 예매를 준비 중인 선생님께서는 아래 내용을 꼭 확인해 주세요<span lang=\"EN-US\">!</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">🎈</span></b><b> </b><a href=\"https://bluearchive.nexon.com/events/2026/11/5thfestival\" style=\"color:#467886; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">[</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">블루</span></span></b><b> </b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">아카이브</span></span></b><b><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ‘5</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">주년</span></span></b><b> </b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">페스티벌</span></span></b><b><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">’ </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">안내</span></span></b><b> </b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">페이지</span></span></b><b> </b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">바로가기</span></span></b><b><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">]</span></b></a></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">[</span>블루 아카이브 ‘5주년 페스티벌’ 사전 안내]</b></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">🔹</span><b> </b>행사 일시 및 장소</b></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:notosanskr;\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>일시: 11월 7일(토) ~ 11월 8일(일) / 오전 10시 ~ 오후 6시</span></s